### Health
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### List seeded documents
GET http://localhost:3001/api/documents

### List chunks (after ingest)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/chunks

### Re-run seed (needs GROQ_API_KEY)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/documents/seed

### Retrieve snippets only
POST http://localhost:3001/api/retrieve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "can I run a postgres database on spot instances?",
  "limit": 4
}

### RAG answer with citations
POST http://localhost:3001/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "How do EU customers keep data in Ireland?",
  "limit": 4
}

### Ingest a document (chunked + embedded)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "GPU waitlist",
  "content": "GPU instances are on a waitlist. You need 30 days of billing history and an Owner role. Approved workspaces can launch a100.small in us-east-1 only. Spot GPUs are not offered.",
  "metadata": {
    "topic": "compute"
  }
}
